        "slc_cb9684db815ab0200443db4c997700532059a21eca2ea89666eae3a4fa26537c"
      ],
      "text": "The bundled deep-research skill runs multi-task research with persisted status (task progress, tool, evidence/failure counts, tokens), and a run is marked complete only after tasks finish, the report passes a source audit, and project checks pass."
    },
